# PyDev interpreter and AST caches a test run writes into this module, at its root as well as
# beside the fixtures. They record absolute paths from the machine that ran them. `resources`
# already ignores `*.pydevinfo` and `v1_astmanager/` for the tree below it; these cover the
# module root too, which is where a wildcard add picks them up.
*.pydevinfo
v2_indexcache/
